rrect_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le02ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "Companies must contemplate the different benefits that computing and pitfalls offer. In order to make cloud services work, customers should consider some facts. For instance, expert assistance has to be engaged by companies. When organizations call for expert consultants, they're more likely to feel satisfied with the products. Besides, due diligence has to be implemented for companies to go over the vendor's performance and history. The operating characteristics have to be taking into account as well; so that the company backs out of what the vendor has promised and that way, it could avoid expensive disputes. In the same way, the impact that the loss of critical computing functions can cause, it also needs to be considered."}, {"time": "47000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "This is essential because services might hamstring the customer's tasks. Similarly, vendors must provide support regarding any issue that may arise. During the process, companies need to show evidence of the service availability. Customers must also know about the cessation of services that can cause no-payment matters, in other words, invoices have to be paid to avoid the service termination. On the other hand, vendors stand for their companies and that's why they must understand the consequences of a vendor failure. If vendors back out of the agreement, customers don't need to put up with it in case they have more options."}, {"time": "87000", "image": "enpe8n7le02ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Companies have to get involved in handling problems that come from the vendors. For example, if a customer loses access to his information, the company must maintain the back-up and recovery options. Besides, electronic copies have to be given in order to get the information back, and also to obtain access to the software. There are some improvements that cloud services come along with. For instance, the availability of improved software, better agreements between vendors and customers, among others. These agreements have to be discussed in advance to verify costs, benefits, and enhancements."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le02ob05re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}